OL,3,AEx-Tory campaign chief pleads guilty
OL,4,Aover election bet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives' former director of
OL,7,Fcampaigning and his wife have pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty to cheating at gambling by
OL,9,Fplacing bets on the date of the 2024
OL,10,Fgeneral election.
OL,12,FAnthony Lee stood to win approximately
OL,13,F#15,000 after placing more than 60
OL,14,Fsuccessful bets totalling #1,549, the
OL,15,FGambling Commission said.
OL,17,FHe passed confidential information to
OL,18,Fhis wife about when former Prime
OL,19,FMinister Rishi Sunak was planning to
OL,20,Fcall the general election.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
