OL,3,AEx-Tory campaign chief pleads guilty
OL,4,Aover election bet
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Lee, who was a parliamentary
OL,7,Fcandidate at the time, placed eight
OL,8,Fsuccessful bets on the election date
OL,9,Ftotalling #535 and would have profited
OL,10,Fby around #5,000.
